    "slug": "outsourceaccountspayable-estimating-rework-in-approval-matrix-from-correction-and-reopen-records",
    "title": "Estimating rework in approval matrix from correction and reopen records",
    "excerpt": "A grounded accounts payable outsourcing note for AP and finance managers: approval matrix with explicit evidence, decision rights, and a verified close.",
    "published": "2026-10-27",
