    "slug": "outsourceaccountspayable-measuring-cycle-time-for-invoice-intake-from-request-to-verified-close",
    "title": "Measuring cycle time for invoice intake from request to verified close",
    "excerpt": "A grounded accounts payable outsourcing note for AP and finance managers: invoice intake with explicit evidence, decision rights, and a verified close.",
